Adding photos to a note the user has edited: their figures go at the
end, and every other byte stays as it was. Photo 2 already has a
figure, so it gets none.
-- request.json --
{
	"protocol": 5,
	"op": "publish",
	"service": [
		{
			"id": 10,
			"path": [
				"Recent"
			]
		}
	],
	"collection": 10,
	"photos": [
		{
			"uuid": "B2000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/2.jpg"
		},
		{
			"uuid": "C3000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/3.jpg",
			"caption": "Third"
		},
		{
			"uuid": "D4000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
			"rendition": "$RENDER/4.jpg"
		}
	]
}
-- render/2.jpg --
full 2 new
-- render/3.jpg --
full 3 new
-- render/4.jpg --
full 4 new
-- vault/Galleries/Recent.md --
---
cssclasses:
  - image-grid
lightroom-collection: 10
lightroom-path: Recent
---
Intro I wrote, with a footnote.[^1]

